  "description": "Full throttle off-road and maximum versatility - the Wild Creed gives you the full range of off-road performance for trail action, bike park and enduro racing. Equipped with the RockShox Ultimate suspension with 170/160 mm travel, coil shock and the new 4-Link Swingarm technology, you are ready for tough downhills - and have the best possible pedalling efficiency on the next climb. Developed with the pros from Team BULLS, the new monocoque full carbon frame offers the best possible handling and maximum control. In addition, uncompromising equipment down to the last detail with Rumble Escalator Pro dropper post, Rumble Altimate Pro carbon handlebar/stem unit and Mavic Deemax Enduro wheels with snappy Schwalbe Magic Mary/Big Betty tyres.",
